asc-comm development patch package

  --install                       Install or update all packaged Hcomm headers
  --uninstall                     Restore first-install originals and remove new files
  --check                         Verify the archive and payload without modifying CANN
  --install-path=<CANN_ROOT>       Select the CANN root; default: ASCEND_HOME_PATH
  --force                         Override version or installed-file consistency checks

Public headers are installed under asc/include/adv_api/hcomm/. Detail headers
are installed under asc/impl/adv_api/detail/hcomm/. Existing files are backed
up under var/asc-comm-dev-patch/baseline/. This package is intended only for
local development verification. Recompile the target Ascend C kernel after
installation. Only paths present in the package manifest are managed; this is
not a full directory mirror. --force does not override architecture or payload
checksum checks.
